      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T07:51:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this needed? We\u0027d really like to avoid this especially because there is no reminder to add to this file list when new templates are added.\n\nThe invocation of the generator emits a [`depfile`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/generator/generator_lib.gni;drc\u003d06b0435d10620dabc8f137d6e42e93223f29808f;l\u003d113) that should make the listing of templates and all other python files unnecessary.",
      "revId": "a001904f317f80b8d5daee4bfe2b6306b00fdfe2",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fdbf8827_25136d28",
        "filename": "generator/dawn_generator.gni",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 31,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T08:10:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To run the action remotely, we need to tell the list of inputs to build system even before the action generates inputs list in depfile. And we\u0027d like to specify inputs in build config correctly rather than relying on depfile so that we can utilize remote execution more (e.g. parallel execution, cache sharing).",
      "parentUuid": "c45284fa_e2c7928a",
      "revId": "a001904f317f80b8d5daee4bfe2b6306b00fdfe2",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "11621168_696506fa",
        "filename": "generator/dawn_generator.gni",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 31,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T08:16:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s quite unfortunate :/\n\nIf we need to do it, we should do something where we change `generator_lib.py` to take in a list of paths of dependencies and validates that the list match exactly what is produced [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/generator/generator_lib.py;drc\u003d06b0435d10620dabc8f137d6e42e93223f29808f;l\u003d345). Then change `generator_lib_action` and `dawn_json_generator` to take in the list of dependencies explicitly as a `gen_deps` (name tbd). This way each code generation target will list exactly the dependencies that it has and we avoid false dependencies.\n\nWe can also have a `dawn_template_dir` defined in `generator_lib.gni` to replace all uses of `${dawn_root}/generator/templates/`.",
      "parentUuid": "fdbf8827_25136d28",
      "revId": "a001904f317f80b8d5daee4bfe2b6306b00fdfe2",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
